2026-10-20T07:29:51.8179150Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8179840Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8180714Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8181722Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8182320Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8182792Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8183216Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8183755Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8184204Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8184685Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8194145Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8195710Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8296255Z PASS a malformed discover block degrades to defaults, never throws
2026-10-20T07:29:51.8298123Z PASS a freshly seeded sources.json carries the discover block
